  WrittenDialogue: "I never thought being the head of a new religion would have so many haters.\nAll I did was desecrate their God, why would they have such a problem with this??\nThere’s been bullets flying through the windows all night now!\nEagle scouts and guys who don’t talk to their children have really good aim.\nC’mon, help me fight these guys off!"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
